 close-up two-shot, shallow depth of field, focusing on their eyes and expressions. (S1) and (S2) hold each other's gaze, the corner of their mouths slightly curved in a默契默契 smile. Raindrops glisten on their hair and shoulders. The background neon blurs into creamy bokeh circles. The camera holds static. Hard cut.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.000, the camera cuts to a medium close-up. (S1) reaches into his jacket pocket and pulls out a vintage silver lighter. At the same time, (S2) raises the unlit cigarette to her lips. Their movements are synchronized and unhurried. The camera slowly pans left to follow (S1)'s hand movement. Keep (S1)'s leather jacket and (S2)'s coat and choker unchanged. Hard cut.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:10.500, the camera cuts to an extreme close-up of the lighter. (S1) flips the lid open with his thumb and strikes the wheel. A warm orange flame ignites and flickers, illuminating the lower half of both their faces with golden light. (S2) leans in slightly, the cigarette tip touching the flame. The first wisp of smoke rises. The camera holds static with the flame centered. Hard cut.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:13.000, the camera cuts to a medium shot, slight low angle. (S1) closes the lighter and slips it back into his pocket. (S2) takes a slow drag, exhales a thin stream of smoke that drifts upward into the rain. They stand side by side, not looking at each other anymore, both gazing toward the blurred city lights in the distance. The camera slowly pulls out with medium amplitude at slow speed, revealing more of the rain-soaked street and neon-lit skyline. The shot ends with both figures in silhouette against the glowing city backdrop.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft rain on pavement, distant city traffic hum, faint neon sign buzz, the metallic click of the lighter lid, the gentle scrape of the flint, subtle cigarette paper crackle, a slow exhale of breath mixing with the rain.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nSlow jazz noir, muted trumpet melody over a walking bassline, melancholic and intimate, low intensity with sparse piano chords, no percussion, gradually fading to silence in the final two seconds.\n", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 263, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 264, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 265, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 289, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 288, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "link": 290, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "label": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_video_audio_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "label": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_audio_0"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 293, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 274, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 275, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 276, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}, {"widget": {"name": "ref_image_size"}, "name": "ref_im